#: contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:137
msgid ""
"Crypto-hub provides real-time crypto market monitoring via 15 desktop card "
"types, auto-refresh, and a local SQLite database for offline coin search. "
"The project is fully open source under the GNU GPLv3 license."
msgstr "Crypto-hub offre un suivi en temps réel du marché des cryptomonnaies via 15 types de cartes de bureau, un rafraîchissement automatique et une base de données SQLite locale pour la recherche hors ligne. Le projet est entièrement open source sous licence GNU GPLv3."

#: contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:168
msgid "Key features of version v1.0.0:"
msgstr "Fonctionnalités clés de la version v1.0.0 :"

#: contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:182
msgid ""
"🚀 Official release for KDE Plasma 6 and Qt 6 environment.\n"
"🪙 15 modular desktop widget cards (Price, Market Cap, Halving, ETH/BTC, "
"Rainbow Zone, etc.).\n"
"📊 Market analytics feed with top gainers, losers, and trending coins.\n"
"🔔 Flexible system notification builder for price breakouts, ATH/ATL, and "
"Fear & Greed shifts.\n"
"🗄️ Offline coin cache powered by a local SQLite database.\n"
"🎨 Dynamic market condition status icon on the Plasma panel."
msgstr ""

#: contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:227
msgid "Universal Development Hub (UniDevHub)"
msgstr "Universal Development Hub (UniDevHub)"

#: contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:241
msgid ""
"The UniDevHub project was created by a visually impaired developer from "
"Ukraine to build open-source software products, primarily for Linux and "
"Android."
msgstr "Le projet UniDevHub (Universal Development Hub) a été créé par un développeur malvoyant d'Ukraine pour concevoir des logiciels open source, principalement pour Linux et Android."

#: contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:250
msgid "Project Goals:"
msgstr "Objectifs du projet :"

#: contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:263
msgid "1. Create software products missing in daily use."
msgstr "1. Créer des logiciels qui manquent au quotidien."

#: contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:273
msgid "2. Involve more people in open-source development."
msgstr "2. Impliquer plus de personnes dans le développement open source."

#: contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:283
msgid "3. Promote open-source software and digital sovereignty."
msgstr "3. Promouvoir le logiciel open source et la souveraineté numérique."

#: contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:293
msgid "4. Stay connected with community and ensure accessibility for everyone."
msgstr "4. Rester connecté avec la communauté et garantir l'accessibilité pour tous."

#: contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:330
msgid "Join the UniDevHub project!"
msgstr "Rejoignez le projet UniDevHub !"

#: contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:337
msgid ""
"Whether you are a developer, designer, translator, or user — your ideas and "
"contribution will help make open-source software better and more accessible "
"for everyone."
msgstr "Que vous soyez développeur, designer, traducteur ou utilisateur, vos idées et votre contribution aideront à rendre les logiciels libres meilleurs et plus accessibles à tous."

